# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type }})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Use it to reference a volume Terraform did not create, such as an existing disk to attach to a new
machine. Declaring it as a resource instead would hand Terraform ownership of it, and a later
`terraform destroy` would delete the volume and its snapshots.

